{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20575","headline":"送李仆射愬赴镇凤翔 · 张籍","name":"送李仆射愬赴镇凤翔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由来勳业属英雄，兄弟连营列位同。\n先入贼城擒首恶，尽封筦库让元公。\n旌幢独继家声外，竹帛新添国史中。\n天子新收秦陇地，故教移镇古扶风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}